## History:
##		- 20261012 tt: Created, after b28l's first boot on its laptop stopped at "Cannot get properties of
##		  rpool_edkh3: no such pool available." The stock initrd import ran once and gave up.
##		- 20261012 tt:
##			- Moved to /usr/sbin, so tkz-zfs-import.service can run it before /usr/local is mounted.
##			- '--root' now runs before the stock import and activates the rd.lvm.lv= volumes first. With
##			  rd.neednet=1 and no network, the stock initrd held LVM back for 2 minutes, so the stock
##			  import scanned before the LV existed.
##			- Forces only pools whose devices are all inside the boot LUKS container. 'zfs_force=1' forced
##			  every pool the initrd could see.
##			- "Last error" shows the forced try's message. Accepts quoted 'root=' and 'rootfstype=zfs root=pool/ds'.
##•••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••
